<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST. JOSEPH 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher.  Top $56.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-260 lbs    55.50-56.00</p>
<p>US 1-2 pkg	223 lbs    55.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	500-550 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>		550-700 lbs    47.00-48.00</p>
